{"duration_api_ms":3400,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0ff36fc9-5c2d-4013-8ea1-59d492ea70c7","total_cost_usd":0.0007681000000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":782,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":432},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1041,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":782,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1041,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1041},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1584,"outputTokens":803,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1041,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0007681000000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":432,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":1041,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Mixed umbrella:** The ETF label attaches to individual sub-funds, not the umbrella ICAV or plc. Each sub-fund has its own LEI and prospectus description. Only exchange-traded sub-funds described as ETFs should carry the label. Others in the same umbrella are not ETFs, despite sharing the wrapper.\n\n**Sub-fund versus listed class:** A sub-fund is identified by its own LEI and name. Each share class has its own ISIN. Exchange listings add tickers (for example, Euronext or LSE lines) that identify a specific listed class, currency, or venue.\n\n**Listed and unlisted classes:** The ETF identifier applies to the listed class, not the whole sub-fund. Unlisted classes keep their own ISINs, are not exchange-traded, and should not be labelled ETFs.\n\n**Caveat:** \"UCITS ETF\" is a market term, not a separate UCITS legal category. Verify any label against the Central Bank of Ireland register and each fund's prospectus and KIID before relying on it.","ttft_ms":1763,"type":"result","duration_ms":2771,"uuid":"af5be3d4-c04d-4ede-9786-08dc9e294040","ttft_stream_ms":411,"time_to_request_ms":50,"first_content_frame_ms":411,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
